{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We consider the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sequence\" title=\"Sequence\">sequence</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_number\" title=\"Real number\">real numbers</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d12979f2e52f832bc31c4e132b3327c337d6ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle a_1,a_2,a_3\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"11\" />, such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/b/84b16161509fc81d43ce3983057c5f36feba3fa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/c/a7c4c84cd04bf09b23af76a4714f60d649e3e1e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/9/43985088115c48fd6d1459dbaab36ce61b4fa61a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle a_n=a_{n-1}-a_{n-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/f/fefc63167dd56d866657ccc2ad9ababfb0585d48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall n \\in \\{3,4,5,6\\ldots\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />. The value of the term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/f/19f213e1855098b14469408b7507d0571fa92da5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle a_{138}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"28\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/2/ec200bed945949b1b115a928ae0f16be281b01b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 0\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } -1\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 2\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"386\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first few terms of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Recursion\" title=\"Recursion\">sequence</a> are:\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">0, 1, 1, 0, -1, -1, 0, 1, 1, 0 &#8230;</div>\n<p>The sequence repeats every 6 terms, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/c/4bcb1bb70528cdbfedab02209572efc3b966983f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle 138\\equiv0\\pmod6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/9/7a90b5116b10724c835c6715082aeaa52e05501c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{138}=-1\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/